# Firebase client config for Android/FCM. Not a secret in the cryptographic sense --
# it ships inside every APK -- but it is environment-specific, so it stays out of the
# repo. EAS holds it as the file secret GOOGLE_SERVICES_JSON; app.config.ts resolves
# either that or this local copy. See docs/RELEASING.md.
google-services.json
